---
source: crates/mori-checker/src/tests.rs
description: "Code:\n\nprofile \"moriarty-beta/1\";\nagreement Lists {\n  domain Preview = { id: \"preview\", chain: \"midnight\", network: \"preview\" };\n  account alice = { domain: Preview, id: \"alice\" };\n  grant g = { signers: [alice, \"bob\"] };\n  stage s = { domain: Preview, reads: \"balance\", authority: 5 };\n  episode e = { id: \"e\", stages: [g] };\n}\n"
---
mori::check::wrong_field

  × The field `signers` of a grant must be a list of accounts, but this item
  │ is a string.
   ╭─[test.mori:5:32]
 4 │   account alice = { domain: Preview, id: "alice" };
 5 │   grant g = { signers: [alice, "bob"] };
   ·                                ──┬──
   ·                                  ╰── this is a string
 6 │   stage s = { domain: Preview, reads: "balance", authority: 5 };
   ╰────

mori::check::wrong_field

  × The field `reads` of a stage must be a list of strings, but this is a
  │ string.
   ╭─[test.mori:6:39]
 5 │   grant g = { signers: [alice, "bob"] };
 6 │   stage s = { domain: Preview, reads: "balance", authority: 5 };
   ·                                       ────┬────
   ·                                           ╰── this is a string
 7 │   episode e = { id: "e", stages: [g] };
   ╰────

mori::check::wrong_field

  × The field `authority` of a stage must be a grant or a string, but this is
  │ a plain number.
   ╭─[test.mori:6:61]
 5 │   grant g = { signers: [alice, "bob"] };
 6 │   stage s = { domain: Preview, reads: "balance", authority: 5 };
   ·                                                             ┬
   ·                                                             ╰── this is a plain number
 7 │   episode e = { id: "e", stages: [g] };
   ╰────
